<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>부산기계공업고등학교 | 학교 규정 안내</title>
  <meta name="description" content="부산기계공업고등학교 학칙 및 규정 안내 페이지입니다. 학생 생활 규정, 출결 규정, 징계 규정, 실습 안전 규정 등을 한눈에 확인하세요.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css">
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #0d2137;
      --navy-2: #123253;
      --blue: #1d5c96;
      --blue-light: #e8f1fa;
      --orange: #ff6b35;
      --orange-soft: #fff1ea;
      --ink: #1c2733;
      --muted: #5b6a78;
      --line: #e3e9ef;
      --bg: #f6f8fa;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --radius: 14px;
      --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(13, 33, 55, .08);
      --shadow-hover: 0 16px 40px rgba(13, 33, 55, .14);
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: "Pretendard Variable", Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--bg);
      line-height: 1.65;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    img, svg { display: block; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    ul { list-style: none; }

    .container { width: min(1120px, 92%); margin: 0 auto; }
    .container-narrow { width: min(760px, 92%); }

    /* ---------- Header ---------- */
    .header {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      transition: box-shadow .25s ease;
    }
    .header.scrolled { box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(13, 33, 55, .08); }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      height: 68px; gap: 16px;
    }

    .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; }
    .logo-mark {
      flex: none; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy), var(--blue));
      color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center;
    }
    .logo-text { line-height: 1.2; }
    .logo-text strong { display: block; font-size: 16px; color: var(--navy); letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .logo-text small { font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: .04em; }

    .nav { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
    .nav a {
      padding: 8px 13px; border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy-2);
      transition: background .2s, color .2s;
    }
    .nav a:hover { background: var(--blue-light); color: var(--blue); }

    .hamburger {
      display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;
      background: none; border: 0; cursor: pointer; padding: 8px;
    }
    .hamburger span { width: 22px; height: 2px; background: var(--navy); border-radius: 2px; transition: .25s; }
    .hamburger.open span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg); }
    .hamburger.open span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
    .hamburger.open span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg); }

    /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
    .hero {
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      background: linear-gradient(150deg, #0a1b2e 0%, var(--navy) 45%, #16406b 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 150px 0 90px;
    }
    .hero-gear {
      position: absolute; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .06);
      animation: spin 40s linear infinite;
    }
    .gear-lg { width: 420px; height: 420px; top: -80px; right: -100px; }
    .gear-sm { width: 200px; height: 200px; bottom: -50px; left: 6%; animation-direction: reverse; animation-duration: 30s; }
    @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .22);
      padding: 7px 16px; border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 50px);
      font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.03em; line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .hero h1 em { font-style: normal; color: #ffb38a; }
    .hero-sub {
      margin-top: 18px; max-width: 620px;
      font-size: 16.5px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .82);
    }
    .hero-btns { margin-top: 30px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      padding: 13px 26px; border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;
      border: 1.5px solid transparent;
      transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s, background .2s, color .2s;
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--orange); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(255, 107, 53, .35); }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #f4551b; }
    .btn-ghost { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .45); color: #fff; }
    .btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .12); }
    .btn-outline { border-color: var(--navy); color: var(--navy); background: transparent; }
    .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--navy); color: #fff; }

    /* ---------- Notice ---------- */
    .notice {
      background: var(--orange-soft);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ffd9c6;
    }
    .notice-inner {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;
      padding: 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #7a3d1d;
    }
    .notice-icon { flex: none; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .notice strong { color: #b04a12; }

    /* ---------- Section ---------- */
    .section { padding: 84px 0; }
    .section-alt { background: var(--white); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }

    .section-head { max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: 44px; }
    .section-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em;
      color: var(--orange);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(24px, 3.4vw, 34px); font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.02em; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .section-head p { margin-top: 14px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15.5px; }

    /* ---------- Intro cards ---------- */
    .purpose-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
    .purpose-card {
      background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 30px 26px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow); transition: transform .25s, box-shadow .25s;
    }
    .purpose-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover); }
    .purpose-card .p-icon {
      width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--blue-light); color: var(--blue);
      display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .purpose-card h3 { font-size: 17.5px; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .purpose-card p { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--muted); }

    /* ---------- Category quick links ---------- */
    .cat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
    .cat-card {
      background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 22px 16px;
      text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transition: transform .25s, box-shadow .25s, border-color .25s;
      display: block;
    }
    .cat-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover); border-color: var(--orange); }
    .cat-card .c-icon { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .cat-card strong { display: block; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--navy); }
    .cat-card span { display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: .06em; }

    /* ---------- Tabs ---------- */
    .tabs {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .tab-btn {
      padding: 11px 20px; border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--line); background: var(--white);
      font-family: inherit; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted);
      cursor: pointer; transition: all .2s;
    }
    .tab-btn:hover { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); }
    .tab-btn.active { background: var(--navy); border-color: var(--navy); color: #fff; }

    .tab-panel { display: none; }
    .tab-panel.active { display: block; animation: fadeUp .35s ease; }
    @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }

    /* ---------- Accordion (규정 조항) ---------- */
    .rule-list { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .rule-item {
      background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; transition: box-shadow .2s;
    }
    .rule-item.open { box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .rule-item.hide { display: none; }
    .rule-q {
      width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
      padding: 18px 20px; background: none; border: 0;
      font-family: inherit; font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy);
      cursor: pointer; text-align: left;
    }
    .rule-no {
      flex: none; min-width: 52px; text-align: center;
      background: var(--blue-light); color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; padding: 5px 8px; border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .rule-arrow { margin-left: auto; flex: none; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); transition: transform .25s; }
    .rule-item.open .rule-arrow { transform: rotate(180deg); color: var(--orange); }
    .rule-a { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height .3s ease; }
    .rule-a-inner { padding: 2px 20px 20px; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--muted); }
    .rule-a-inner ul { margin-top: 6px; }
    .rule-a-inner li { position: relative; padding-left: 16px; margin-top: 5px; }
    .rule-a-inner li::before {
      content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: .62em;
      width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--orange);
    }
    .rule-a-inner b { color: var(--ink); }

    /* ---------- Points table ---------- */
    .table-wrap {
      background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14.5px; }
    thead th {
      background: var(--navy); color: #fff;
      padding: 14px 18px; text-align: left; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    tbody td { padding: 13px 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink); }
    tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #fafcfe; }
    .pt-chip {
      display: inline-block; min-width: 44px; text-align: center;
      padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 800;
      background: var(--orange-soft); color: var(--orange);
    }
    .pt-chip.high { background: #fde8e8; color: #c0392b; }
    .pt-chip.mid { background: #fff4d6; color: #b7791f; }

    /* ---------- Process timeline ---------- */
    .proc { position: relative; margin-top: 8px; }
    .proc::before {
      content: ""; position: absolute; left: 19px; top: 12px; bottom: 12px;
      width: 2px; background: linear-gradient(var(--blue), var(--orange));
    }
    .proc-item { position: relative; padding: 0 0 26px 62px; }
    .proc-item:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
    .proc-no {
      position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;
      width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--navy); color: #fff;
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--bg);
    }
    .proc-item h4 { font-size: 16.5px; color: var(--navy); }
    .proc-item p { margin-top: 5px; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 560px; }

    /* ---------- Safety highlight ---------- */
    .safety-band {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #12263d, #1d5c96);
      border-radius: 18px; padding: 44px 40px; color: #fff;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 34px; align-items: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
    }
    .safety-band h3 { font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .safety-band h3 em { font-style: normal; color: #ffb38a; }
    .safety-band > div > p { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .82); font-size: 15px; }
    .safety-rules { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
    .safety-rule {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .08); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .16);
      border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .safety-rule .s-no {
      flex: none; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 7px;
      background: var(--orange); display: grid; place-items: center;
      font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 800;
    }

    /* ---------- FAQ ---------- */
    .faq-list { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .faq-item {
      background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .faq-q {
      width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px;
      padding: 18px 20px; background: none; border: 0;
      font-family: inherit; font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy);
      cursor: pointer; text-align: left;
    }
    .faq-arrow { flex: none; color: var(--orange); transition: transform .25s; }
    .faq-item.open .faq-arrow { transform: rotate(180deg); }
    .faq-a { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height .3s ease; }
    .faq-a p { padding: 0 20px 18px; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--muted); }

    /* ---------- CTA ---------- */
    .cta-box {
      background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 36px 30px;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .cta-box h3 { color: var(--navy); font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .cta-box p { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14.5px; }
    .cta-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end; }

    /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
    .footer { background: var(--navy); color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78); padding: 48px 0 30px; }
    .footer-inner { display: grid; gap: 22px; justify-items: start; }
    .footer-brand strong { display: block; color: #fff; font-size: 17px; }
    .footer-brand p { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13.5px; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; font-size: 13.5px; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: #fff; text-decoration: underline; }
    .copy { font-size: 12.5px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .5); }

    /* ---------- to top ---------- */
    .to-top {
      position: fixed; right: 26px; bottom: 26px; z-index: 90;
      width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%;
      border: 0; background: var(--navy); color: #fff;
      font-size: 18px; cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
      opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transform: translateY(10px);
      transition: opacity .25s, transform .25s;
    }
    .to-top.show { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; transform: none; }

    /* ---------- reveal ---------- */
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); transition: opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease; }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

    /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .purpose-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cat-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
      .safety-band { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 34px 26px; }
      .cta-box { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cta-actions { justify-content: flex-start; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .nav {
        position: fixed; top: 68px; left: 0; right: 0;
        flex-direction: column; gap: 0;
        background: var(--white); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 10px 14px 16px;
        transform: translateY(-130%); transition: transform .3s ease;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
      }
      .nav.open { transform: none; }
      .nav a { padding: 13px 10px; border-radius: 8px; }
      .hamburger { display: flex; }
      .hero { padding: 120px 0 70px; }
      .cat-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .section { padding: 64px 0; }
      thead { display: none; }
      tbody td { display: block; border-top: 0; padding: 8px 18px; }
      tbody tr { display: block; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 10px 0; }
      tbody td:first-child { font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="header" id="header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="index.html" class="logo">
        <span class="logo-mark">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="logo-text">
          <strong>부산기계공업고등학교</strong>
          <small>SCHOOL RULES &amp; REGULATIONS</small>
        </span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav" id="nav">
        <a href="#purpose">규정이란?</a>
        <a href="#categories">규정 한눈에 보기</a>
        <a href="#rules">규정 상세</a>
        <a href="#points">징계·벌점</a>
        <a href="#safety">실습 안전</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="메뉴 열기">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-gear gear-lg">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="100%" height="100%"><path fill="currentColor" d="M50 15l6 10 11-4 2 12 12 2-4 11 10 6-10 6 4 11-12 2-2 12-11-4-6 10-6-10-11 4-2-12-12-2 4-11-10-6 10-6-4-11 12-2 2-12 11 4z"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="14" fill="#0d2137"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-gear gear-sm">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="100%" height="100%"><path fill="currentColor" d="M50 15l6 10 11-4 2 12 12 2-4 11 10 6-10 6 4 11-12 2-2 12-11-4-6 10-6-10-11 4-2-12-12-2 4-11-10-6 10-6-4-11 12-2 2-12 11 4z"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="14" fill="#0d2137"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <span class="hero-badge">학칙 및 학생생활 규정</span>
      <h1>알고 지내면 편한<br><em>부기공 학교 규정</em> 안내</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        학교 규정은 우리 모두가 안전하고 즐겁게 배울 수 있도록 만든 약속입니다.<br>
        생활·출결·징계·실습 안전 규정까지, 궁금한 내용을 지금 바로 확인해 보세요.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-btns">
        <a href="#rules" class="btn btn-primary">규정 상세 보기</a>
        <a href="#faq" class="btn btn-ghost">자주 묻는 질문</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="notice">
    <div class="container notice-inner">
      <span class="notice-icon">⚠️</span>
